  "title": "Pesto-Stuffed Pork Chops",
  "description": "This recipe for pesto stuffed pork chops stuffs bone-in chops with feta cheese, basil pesto, and pine nuts and then bakes with a balsamic vinegar glaze.",
  "authors": [
    "SDaisy2"
  ],
